{"id":"tysyacha","lemma":"тысяча","pos":"noun","rank":2295,"glosses":["set of thousand","one thousand ruble banknote"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/42/Ru-%D1%82%D1%8B%D1%81%D1%8F%D1%87%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D1%82%D1%8B%D1%81%D1%8F%D1%87%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"тысячи","plural":"тысячи"},"formAudio":{"тысячи":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/LL-Q7737_%28rus%29-Lvova-%D1%82%D1%8B%D1%81%D1%8F%D1%87%D0%B8.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Тысячи людей были там.","en":"Thousands of people were there.","words":[null,{"g":"people, humans","l":"люди"},{"g":"were","l":"быть"},{"g":"there"}]},{"text":"Тысячи людей хотели знать ответ.","en":"Thousands of people wanted to know the answer.","words":[null,{"g":"people, humans","l":"люди"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…"},{"g":"answer"}]},{"text":"Тысяча долларов - большая сумма.","en":"A thousand dollars is a large sum.","words":[null,null,{"g":"big, large, great","l":"большой"},{"g":"sum"}]},{"text":"Том должен мне три тысячи долларов.","en":"Tom owes me three thousand dollars.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"must, have to"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"three"},null,null]},{"text":"Тысяча метров - это километр.","en":"A thousand meters is a kilometer.","words":[null,{"g":"meter/metre","l":"метр"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"kilometer/kilometre"}]}]}